Package: bigIRT
Title: Item Response Theory for Large Sparse Data
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Charles",
           family = "Driver",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "charles.driver@psychologie.uzh.ch",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4174-2970"))
Author: Charles Driver [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Charles Driver <charles.driver@psychologie.uzh.ch>
Description: Fits binary item response theory (IRT) models for large and sparse
    data in long format. Supports 1PL to 4PL models, optional covariate effects
    on item and person parameters, empirical-Bayes style prior adaptation, and
    helper tools for simulation and weighted-likelihood scoring.
